Subject: [PATCH 36/47] reward-background-return: require Node >=22.6
 explicitly; report BLOCKED_NODE on older Node (never a pass)

The test needs node:module.stripTypeScriptTypes (Node >=22.6). On older Node it now prints
'BLOCKED_NODE: reward-background-return requires Node >=22.6 (node:module.stripTypeScriptTypes),
found vX' and exits 78; run-suite.cjs maps exit 78 + that marker to status BLOCKED with the reason
(console: BLOCKED_NODE (...)), mirroring navigation-guard's BLOCKED_BROWSER. Any other non-zero
exit is still FAIL. README: how to run it on the Mac with Node 22 (npx node@22 / nvm).
